    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy wont change what i did. it just makes me sit there and replay it over and over. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable, like i'm just taking up space that could belong to someone who actually deserves to be here. if someone does something unforgivable, shouldn't there be a way to just... stop the bleeding? to just make sure the harm stops with me?",
