      "content": "Therapy is not about erasing the past, but about learning how to carry the weight without suffocating your present or others in the future. Since no amount of mental effort can physically remove yourself from causing harm, safety planning with a professional is the only way to ensure no one else suffers your pain while you work through it. You do not deserve to be a parasite, but healing is a fragile journey that often begins with taking the one step forward to get help before things slip completely away.",
